            "review_title": "Review at Bonggu Beer",
            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6958 contributions\n0\nRecommended\nMay 2022\nHad some delicious crispy fried chicken that was so so good, and drank some wheat beer that also tasted pretty decent.....\nNice atmosphere with a lot of Korea ex pats in attendance, lively and friendly.\nService was fast and efficient.\nNice decor and loved the setting of the restaurant.\nAll in all a very pleasurable experience.\nGood food in a lovely setting washed down with nice cold beers. \nAlso it was very, very affordable, my bill coming at a lowly 14 euros....brilliant value for two people eating out. \nRecommended\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 22, 2022",
